      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فجّى</span></b> , (TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفْجِيَةٌ</span>, (K, TA,) <i>He
removed; put away,</i> or <i>at a distance;</i> (K, * TA;)
and <i>pushed, thrust,</i> or <i>drove, away;</i> persons from
others; (TA;) syn. of the inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَشْفٌ</span>; and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنْحِيَةٌ</span>; (K, TA;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَفْعٌ</span>. (TA.)

